# Hima production signing config — local only, NEVER commit.
#
# To activate signed-release builds:
#   1. Copy this file to: app/keystore.properties  (drop the .example)
#   2. Replace YOUR_PASSWORD_HERE with your real key0.jks password
#   3. Save. Future `./gradlew assembleProductionRelease` will produce a
#      signed APK that matches the Play Store signature, so PhonePe +
#      Cashfree payments work for side-loaded builds too.
